// A multi-measure rest longer than the church-rest expand-limit (10) prints the
// big_rest H-bar: a thick horizontal block bar with vertical end serifs and a
// bold count above. Regression coverage for DrawBigRest — previously no fixture
// exercised the big_rest path, which let its bar/serif thickness drift from LP
// (thick-thickness 6.6 x line-thickness, hair-thickness 2.0 x line-thickness).
// LILYPOND-REF: lily/multi-measure-rest.cc:194-220 big_rest.
title "Multi-measure rest (long / H-bar)"

time 4/4

part melody

section Main {
  melody {
    c'4 e g e |
    R1*12 |
    c'4 e g e |
  }
}
